Judg 12:1 , The Ephraimites, quarrelling with Jephthah, and discerned by Shibboleth, are slain by the Gileadites;
Judg 12:7 , Jephthah dies;
Judg 12:8 , Ibzan, who had thirty sons, and thirty daughters;
Judg 12:11 , and Elon;
Judg 12:13 , and Abdon, who had forty sons, and thirty nephews, judge Israel.
